usage: tokenspeed serve [-h] [--headless]

Launch the TokenSpeed inference server: the full serving stack by default (an
smg gateway fronting the engine over smg's direct ZMQ lane), or the engine
alone with --headless.

options:
  -h, --help  show this help message and exit
  --headless  Run the engine only, without a frontend. An external frontend —
              e.g. `smg serve --backend tokenspeed --connection-mode zmq` or
              Dynamo — binds the msgpack ZMQ sockets and this engine dials in
              at --data-parallel-address/--data-parallel-rpc-port (default
              tcp://127.0.0.1:30500).
